<title>USA: United Asset Management Q1 net, shr rise.</title>
<headline>United Asset Management Q1 net, shr rise.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended March 31,   1997	1996  (1)  Increase</p>
<p> Revenues		     $215,522,000  $208,522,000	 3%</p>
<p> Operating income	     50,452,000    45,311,000	11%</p>
<p>Income before income tax</p>
<p>  expense			 42,054,000    34,256,000	23%</p>
<p> Net income		     24,055,000    19,487,000	23%</p>
<p>Operating Cash Flow (net</p>
<p>income plus amortization</p>
<p>  and depreciation)	   51,824,000    50,732,000	 2%</p>
<p> Average shares		 69,332,000    67,847,000	---</p>
<p> Primary earnings per share  $.33	     .28	     18%</p>
<p>Fully diluted earnings per</p>
<p>  share			    $.33	     .27	     22%</p>
<p>Operating Cash Flow per</p>
<p>share (under same method</p>
<p>used to calculate</p>
<p>  earnings per share)	  $.71	     .70		1%</p>
<p>Assets under management at</p>
<p>March 31</p>
<p>As originally reported $171,425,000,000  $148,756,000,000 15%  As restated		$171,425,000,000  $158,415,000,000 8%</p>
