<p>  March 31			70,134,000    68,506,000	---</p>
<p>Pro forma per share information, according to Statement</p>
<p>of Financial</p>
<p>Accounting Standards No. 128 (2):</p>
<p> Basic earnings per share	    .35	.29	     21%</p>
<p> Diluted earnings per share	  .33	.27	     22%</p>
<p> Operating Cash Flow per share     .71	.71		0%</p>
<p>(1) Restated due to pooling of interests transactions completed in Q3 1996 and the two-for-one common stock split effective June 7, 1996.</p>
<p>(2) Pro forma EPS calculated in accordance with Statement of Financial Accounting Standards No. 128, EPS, which will be effective for financial statements for both interim and annual periods ending after December 15, 1997.</p>
<p>Full company name is United Asset Management Corp.</p>
